<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Container Units Playground</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Card titles sized with cqi: they follow the card's width, not the screen's.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/driver.js@1.3.1/dist/driver.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../shared/base.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../shared/controls.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../shared/compat.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../shared/tour.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../shared/info.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../shared/grid.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style.css">
    <script>
      // Set the theme before first paint (saved choice, else system).
      try {
        const saved = localStorage.getItem("playground-theme");
        document.documentElement.dataset.theme = saved || (matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: light)").matches ? "light" : "dark");
      } catch {
        document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "dark";
      }
    </script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/driver.js@1.3.1/dist/driver.js.iife.js" defer></script>
    <script src="../shared/theme.js" defer></script>
    <script src="../shared/compat.js" defer></script>
    <script src="../shared/tour.js" defer></script>
    <script src="../shared/info.js" defer></script>
    <script src="../shared/frame.js" defer></script>
    <script src="./script.js" defer></script>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main class="app cq-playground">
      <nav class="app__nav">
        <a class="app__action" href="../index.html" title="All playgrounds">
          <svg class="app__icon app__icon--back" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg>
          <span class="sr-only">All playgrounds</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
      <div class="app__actions">
        <button class="app__action" type="button" id="tour-start" aria-label="Show the walkthrough" title="Show the walkthrough">
          <svg class="app__icon app__icon--help" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.5"/><path d="M9.5 9.2a2.6 2.6 0 0 1 5 .9c0 1.7-2.5 2.3-2.5 3.9"/><path d="M12 17.2h.01"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="app__action" type="button" id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Switch theme">
          <svg class="app__icon app__icon--sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"/></svg>
          <svg class="app__icon app__icon--moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <h1 class="app__title">Container Units Playground</h1>
      <p class="app__intro">
        <code>vw</code> sizes text by the <strong>screen</strong>. <code>cqi</code> sizes it by the <strong>card it's in</strong>:
        <code>1cqi</code> is 1% of the card's width. So the same card gets a big title when it's wide and a smaller one
        when it's narrow, wherever it's placed. Change the columns and watch the titles.
      </p>

      <div class="cq-controls">
        <fieldset class="cq-group cq-group--layout">
          <legend class="cq-group__title">Layout <span class="cq-group__hint">how much room the titles get</span></legend>
          <div class="controls">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="control__head">
                <label class="control__label" for="cols-number">Columns</label>
                <span class="control__input">
                  <input class="control__number" type="number" id="cols-number" min="1" max="4" step="1" value="3" inputmode="numeric">
                </span>
              </div>
              <input class="control__range" type="range" id="cols" min="1" max="4" step="1" value="3" aria-label="Columns (slider)">
            </div>

            <div class="control">
              <div class="control__head">
                <label class="control__label" for="width-number">Section width</label>
                <span class="control__input">
                  <input class="control__number" type="number" id="width-number" min="240" step="1" value="1100" inputmode="numeric">
                  <span class="control__unit">px</span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <input class="control__range" type="range" id="width" min="240" max="1100" step="1" value="1100" aria-label="Section width (slider)">
            </div>

            <div class="cq-group__switch">
              <label class="switch">
                <input class="switch__input" type="checkbox" id="wide">
                <span class="switch__label">First card spans 2 columns</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="cq-group cq-group--unit">
          <legend class="cq-group__title" id="unit-title">Measured by <span class="cq-group__hint">the unit both titles use</span></legend>
          <div class="cq-units">
            <label class="cq-unit">
              <input class="cq-unit__input" type="radio" name="unit" value="cqi" checked>
              <span class="cq-unit__name">cqi</span>
              <span class="cq-unit__text">container width, follows text direction</span>
            </label>
            <label class="cq-unit">
              <input class="cq-unit__input" type="radio" name="unit" value="cqw">
              <span class="cq-unit__name">cqw</span>
              <span class="cq-unit__text">container width</span>
            </label>
            <label class="cq-unit">
              <input class="cq-unit__input" type="radio" name="unit" value="vw">
              <span class="cq-unit__name">vw</span>
              <span class="cq-unit__text">screen width</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="cq-group cq-group--heading">
          <legend class="cq-group__title" id="heading-title">Section title <code class="cq-group__formula" id="heading-formula"></code></legend>
          <div class="controls">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="control__head">
                <label class="control__label" for="hmin-number">Min</label>
                <span class="control__input">
                  <input class="control__number" type="number" id="hmin-number" min="16" max="48" step="1" value="28" inputmode="numeric">
                  <span class="control__unit">px</span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <input class="control__range" type="range" id="hmin" min="16" max="48" step="1" value="28" aria-label="Min (slider)">
            </div>

            <div class="control">
              <div class="control__head">
                <label class="control__label" for="hsize-number">Preferred</label>
                <span class="control__input">
                  <input class="control__number" type="number" id="hsize-number" min="1" max="15" step="0.5" value="6" inputmode="decimal">
                  <span class="control__unit" id="hsize-unit">cqi</span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <input class="control__range" type="range" id="hsize" min="1" max="15" step="0.5" value="6" aria-label="Preferred (slider)">
            </div>

            <div class="control">
              <div class="control__head">
                <label class="control__label" for="hmax-number">Max</label>
                <span class="control__input">
                  <input class="control__number" type="number" id="hmax-number" min="40" max="120" step="1" value="72" inputmode="numeric">
                  <span class="control__unit">px</span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <input class="control__range" type="range" id="hmax" min="40" max="120" step="1" value="72" aria-label="Max (slider)">
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="cq-group cq-group--title">
          <legend class="cq-group__title" id="card-title">Card title <code class="cq-group__formula" id="formula"></code></legend>
          <div class="controls">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="control__head">
                <label class="control__label" for="min-number">Min</label>
                <span class="control__input">
                  <input class="control__number" type="number" id="min-number" min="10" max="32" step="1" value="18" inputmode="numeric">
                  <span class="control__unit">px</span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <input class="control__range" type="range" id="min" min="10" max="32" step="1" value="18" aria-label="Min (slider)">
            </div>

            <div class="control">
              <div class="control__head">
                <label class="control__label" for="size-number">Preferred</label>
                <span class="control__input">
                  <input class="control__number" type="number" id="size-number" min="1" max="15" step="0.5" value="7" inputmode="decimal">
                  <span class="control__unit" id="size-unit">cqi</span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <input class="control__range" type="range" id="size" min="1" max="15" step="0.5" value="7" aria-label="Preferred (slider)">
            </div>

            <div class="control">
              <div class="control__head">
                <label class="control__label" for="max-number">Max</label>
                <span class="control__input">
                  <input class="control__number" type="number" id="max-number" min="24" max="96" step="1" value="48" inputmode="numeric">
                  <span class="control__unit">px</span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <input class="control__range" type="range" id="max" min="24" max="96" step="1" value="48" aria-label="Max (slider)">
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </div>

      <section class="stage" aria-labelledby="stage-title">
        <div class="stage__bar">
          <h2 class="stage__heading" id="stage-title">Section <span class="stage__hint">· drag the corner ↘ to resize</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="frame" id="frame">
          <div class="cq-section" id="section">
            <p class="cq-section__eyebrow">Summer 2026</p>
            <h3 class="cq-section__title" id="section-title">Featured destinations</h3>
            <span class="cq-section__readout" id="section-readout"></span>
            <div class="cq-grid" id="cards"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="compare">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card__head">
            <span class="card__title">CSS</span>
            <button class="card__button" type="button" data-copy="css-code">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <pre class="card__code"><code id="css-code"></code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card__head">
            <span class="card__title">React</span>
            <button class="card__button" type="button" data-copy="react-code">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <pre class="card__code"><code id="react-code"></code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card__head"><span class="card__title">Good to know</span></div>
          <ul class="tips">
            <li><strong>The card must be a container:</strong> <code>container-type: inline-size</code>. Without one, <code>cqi</code> quietly falls back to the screen, like <code>vw</code>.</li>
            <li><code>container: inline-size</code> doesn't do it: the shorthand is <code>name / type</code>. Use <code>container: card / inline-size</code>.</li>
            <li>Each title uses its <strong>nearest</strong> container: card titles follow their card, the big title follows the section. That's why columns change the card titles but not the big one.</li>
            <li>On the container element itself, <code>cqi</code> refers to the next container up, not itself.</li>
            <li><code>cqi</code> follows the reading direction (it's the width in normal horizontal text), so it's the safer default over <code>cqw</code>.</li>
            <li>A container inside a shrink-to-fit parent (flex item, <code>inline-block</code>) can collapse to 0 width: give it a width.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="compat" aria-labelledby="compat-title">
        <h2 class="compat__title" id="compat-title">Browser support</h2>
        <div class="compat__list">
          <div class="compat__feature" data-feature="container-queries" data-label="Container queries + units (cqi, cqw)" data-test="width: 1cqi" data-caniuse="container query units" data-mdn="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Containment/Container_size_and_style_queries"></div>
          <div class="compat__feature" data-feature="min-max-clamp" data-test="width: clamp(1px, 1cqi, 2px)" data-caniuse="clamp" data-mdn="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/clamp"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="compat__source"></p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
